## Author of Latest Modifications (`cmix-neif-3.1`)

* **Copyright (C) 2026 Oleksandr Dreval**
  * GitHub Profile: <https://github.com/OleksandrDreval>
  * Project Repository: <https://github.com/OleksandrDreval/cmix-neif-3.1>
  * Scope of copyright & GPL-3.0 section 5a modifications (November 2026):
    1. Stage-2 self-extracting stub `systrap` warm-up fix and parallelized
       packer build & bit-exact cross-checks (`tools_src/packer/stub.c`,
       `tools_src/packer/build_packer.sh`, `build_and_construct_comp.sh`).
    2. Lossless `.c5` transformer weight container entropy-coding upgrades
       (Sign-Magnitude `ENC_INT4W`, per-canonical-name probability tables,
       refined width bucketing, counting `ENC_BF16C` high-byte trees, and
       `last_zrow` zero-scale skipping) and re-encoded container
       `weights-poc8m_w2048_tf2t3_pruned_v5k_np2.c5` (`src/tf1/`,
       `training/tf/3_train/export/np2/tf1_np_codec.cpp`).
    3. `BITLSTM` slot-1 3-bit mantissa rounding and frozen AVX2/FMA inference
       fast-path (`src/bit_head_weights.h`, `src/bit_head.cpp`).
    4. ~2.86x peak RAM reduction across the `PPMd` page pool and `SEMCACHE`
       plus 4-row AVX2 unrolling in `SemDotPm1` (`src/models/ppmd*.{h,cpp}`,
       `src/semantic_cache.h`, `src/predictor.cpp`).
    5. Compiler warning cleanups across `src/` and analytical/benchmark
       documentation (`en-optimization_report.md`, `uk-optimization_report.md`,
       `CHANGES.md`, `NOTICE.md`, `README.md`).

No copyright claim is made by Oleksandr Dreval over inherited upstream code;
his copyright claim covers the `cmix-neif-3.1` modifications and reports only,
licensed under `GPL-3.0-only`.

